// World events — evaluated against the world clock (DESIGN.md §4).
// Loaded identically by the server (spawning authority) and clients (tint);
// active-state agreement is pure clock math, nothing travels on the wire.
//
// day_seconds: one full day/night cycle (kept short for now so the cycle is
// visible during play sessions; tune freely).
(
    day_seconds: 120.0,
    events: [],
)
